{"id":4227,"title":{"romaji":"Gekkan Mousou Kagaku","english":"Delusional Monthly Magazine","native":"月刊モー想科学"},"slug":"gekkan_mousou_kagaku","synopsis":"The story takes place in the town of Most City in a certain country. On the second floor of an old building is a publishing company that puts out a periodical called Delusional Monthly Magazine, a science magazine featuring articles about shocking, bizarre events and inexplicable phenomena that make even scientists throw up their hands in defeat. Its staff consists only of a beautiful editor-in-chief and her one editor, Tarou J. Suzuki, who are joined by grade-school-aged assistant Jirou Tanaka and his dog, Saburou. The editorial department is always empty, and Tarou, Jirou, and Saburou are usually hanging out in Rock, a coffee shop on the first floor. One day, the scientist Gorou Satou visits them for a consultation, and therein lies the beginning of an outlandish new story...","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2024,"createdAt":"2024-01-11 16:48:10","updatedAt":"2024-03-22 21:16:50","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":56691},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":47972},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":169418},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18202},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":23878},{"site":"ANN","externalId":29966},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11589,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/qjfakjolBz6Hc08i3jWR65wf6zH8DGFiDOWzN50S.jpg"},{"id":11590,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/9ukDW7q4M5GY6Jb4pAmkmhdW6kR0vzKxmPyuF4AO.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":354,"name":"OLM Team Yoshioka","slug":"olm_team_yoshioka"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":12711,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12664,"title":{"romaji":"Overscientific!","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":14872,"version":1,"episodes":"1-","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":